{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I’ve used Bitwarden for ~6 years, and there were a handful of UX issues that annoyed me enough that I finally did something about them.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2536f1896a1685cb73c1b2b8e122b5398f27a75942e50f48f97b840973c8f614.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.54], [3, 1.12, 1.34], [5, 1.66, 2.02], [6, 2.42, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 2.92], [9, 2.92, 3.06], [10, 3.06, 3.38], [11, 3.38, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 3.8], [13, 3.8, 4.28], [14, 4.28, 4.54], [15, 4.54, 4.86], [16, 4.86, 5.06], [17, 5.06, 5.32], [18, 5.32, 5.52], [19, 5.52, 5.64], [20, 5.64, 5.98], [21, 5.98, 6.2], [22, 6.2, 6.52], [23, 6.52, 6.8], [24, 6.8, 7.12]]}, {"text": "quick links", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7b9ae0a89f1f3907fe9ac3e03733324ca4d96a858ff285d6219018958258d216.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.58]]}, {"text": "Google Chrome", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c2987e65ab288b24c19620177493f6d099b34a6c3f949abd043c208900c2fb56.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.62]]}, {"text": "Firefox", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/383dc310f80e79c039856a1ba0515a984ef29ffbac8d1539781e6b3c549251a6.mp3"}, {"text": "Source Code", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7264c9c61afc737ae9106f3462b2ee0c3d8b6e4a99a837a6cbed659d00bb6592.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.64]]}, {"text": "Blog", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3e7e87c6ab0fbcfe14e1c351852036f5b189ba3fce212e4ec8741fffad6655c9.mp3"}, {"text": "The result is Saigon Safe Firefox: a fork of the Bitwarden browser extension, built mostly with AI-assisted coding.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/267aac7de7868c96107972189d85dc0d6a1760780d10b4741b1bbe05e5f8e5da.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.12], [5, 1.42, 2.04], [6, 2.36, 2.42], [7, 2.42, 2.62], [8, 2.62, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 2.92], [11, 3.4, 3.7], [12, 3.7, 4.22], [13, 4.66, 5.04], [14, 5.04, 5.54], [15, 5.54, 5.76], [17, 6.44, 6.78]]}, {"text": "A few features added:", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/22e0842da4e57a8eddf342c2dda3831c04cad0504e0886b7fff819a9a03a5de5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.2]]}, {"text": "One-click account creation", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2f1d678139c47750b816b5f823dff86081af0b3c86be5563c0acc9a969e0687d.mp3"}, {"text": "Set a default email address", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d585c8fa71a0122ff9139d45deb5ab535c36b961cb68513b1af5cdf37070ae9b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.48]]}, {"text": "Generate a strong password", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/685bfe3f49f30de6f0b6fead3a8e4ff0bd991b1017d00f63bb95573d93939e0a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.44]]}, {"text": "Auto-fill the registration form", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/57a19ac795af02140781e61ea1244beaa52bc516d8c661d022defec51cb3ae36.mp3"}, {"text": "Automatically save the credential", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6017c7c591c9a1cf0513449d921ba4e63b2d6901b2a8bbb4aece2dc4ba28b503.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.64], [1, 0.64, 0.9], [2, 0.9, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.44]]}, {"text": "No more:", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8d7715ae824e6de647343b753feed51542caba119b98ca35de425a5234e01cd9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.42]]}, {"text": "Copy password", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7efc40b3c0c46ed01d346ee19012a6e2c130e42bfdcd55e2d874549145baea4f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.74]]}, {"text": "Paste password", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/38de912d997ff94976ce8135c62a21ec3828f7520d7324e04cdec688b4311f41.mp3"}, {"text": "Re-enter email", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d89c842aac3ef4e4c706bc32ff2575138c6709879a35d91cc2b267e69f424bc9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.76]]}, {"text": "Hope Bitwarden notices the new account", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/87ce3461ada77bf3de8ee6fc4a4d361c3f4a063ec25bca839de0044cb226d57e.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.74, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.42], [4, 1.42, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Touch ID unlock", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a4abbcc64cc7ce1229392e6d68049aa101d13b639491a7c206a7a8ab75555cbc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.8]]}, {"text": "Unlock your vault using your laptop’s biometric authentication instead of typing a long master password every time.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7a3d7412807620ce3568abcea87bc67368237052fb23101571dedebebb2065bf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.66], [6, 2.0, 2.34], [8, 3.02, 3.66], [9, 3.66, 3.86], [10, 3.86, 4.14], [11, 4.14, 4.3], [12, 4.3, 4.5], [14, 4.9, 5.36], [15, 5.36, 5.7], [16, 5.7, 6.02]]}, {"text": "UX improvements", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ee0b2fd5ff9b64a6919e5f8e6c598c4beff4258a036daafe2600ce691984c2ca.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 1.06]]}, {"text": "Bottom menu bar moved to top, for faster mouse access", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ad285d02e095aeb0b34b1d1af6e998342ac6f5c15b5ca844cec718cc6a9bb32f.mp3"}, {"text": "If you try to auto-fill and Saigon Safe is logged out, prompt for password (instead of silently failing like today…)", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ea68e463fbfc3fc10020f5f1b552c8d83d6fdb758b0838dd92b5bd7920feb5f6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.68], [5, 1.12, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.78], [8, 2.14, 2.38], [10, 2.52, 2.88], [12, 3.2, 3.46], [13, 3.46, 3.88], [14, 3.88, 4.66], [15, 4.66, 4.84], [16, 4.84, 5.2], [17, 5.2, 5.64], [18, 5.64, 5.9], [19, 5.9, 6.24]]}, {"text": "Auto-fill cycles through current login items.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ff7f8f858d362eca40d26c911b4918adf0b1b9847fe04e287e3370ab25d19542.mp3"}, {"text": "Hidden accounts", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cc2437d915620c19ebb4ad8ab842beab60c95581c2554fff0fd90300d018743e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.54]]}, {"text": "Inspired by Zalo’s hidden conversations.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/291d236e3692b046b7bdbbf9a24653980346a7afc0f30ab55abcd6b9e9911d2c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 2.12]]}, {"text": "Mark sensitive accounts (banks, investments, email providers, etc.)", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/85874927af34421a9b7fbf578e3c76419f18c5d74329258c89c2d221089e4da9.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.26, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 1.1], [3, 1.52, 1.82], [4, 2.02, 2.36], [5, 2.68, 2.9], [6, 2.9, 3.36], [7, 3.72, 4.0]]}, {"text": "as hidden.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f48cfe9eaed51317ab4df2ab7b887b7030507be8e417eaa1c734a1e9322215b2.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.3, 0.54]]}, {"text": "They won’t appear in search results unless you enter a separate secret PIN.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6af645aaaf9eb53d266ab80d571c2a0c010da4c4f1a9eada39e8dc85fe622618.mp3"}, {"text": "This adds a layer of privacy if someone gains access to an unlocked device or vault.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ad79a1bf9b948d46a4f90d55c4412bf06edcf4578e58cf8f677d0aada799c0b0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.28], [7, 1.46, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.94], [9, 1.94, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.64], [11, 2.64, 2.74], [12, 2.74, 3.0], [13, 3.0, 3.38], [14, 3.38, 3.6], [15, 3.6, 3.86]]}, {"text": "This feature is only enforced on the client level.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/157b1c8336f46d804e7aeebe593fb44f538c4d85621338987bd94ab7b3bf5baf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.42]]}, {"text": "The export feature will still reveal the hidden accounts.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f46b1a592675d6541129b543ebf04afaf92ff8e247e006239f91e8fb5d253d46.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [2, 0.6, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.38]]}, {"text": "Less marketing clutter", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4945707a4d9766f115fdeb2740d7f3e63d64f6efcbf3249a941fcb648f007857.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 1.12]]}, {"text": "Removed upsell and promotional UI from the extension.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/10cebb3211a2120aff6694fce6ed3d5005bc370b036c8db279fdf6863fad50f3.mp3"}, {"text": "The extension still uses Bitwarden’s backend and infrastructure.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f1b5ef509d1fd79696f643969d1e733e4a55f7103bc6ec1811918b8d57b654d8.mp3"}, {"text": "Your vault, sync, and encryption work exactly as before—this is purely a client-side experience improvement.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fe2ac8da4fa8bf7c30e8919b73259cd58580209b5727e204ff86871ab94711a0.mp3"}, {"text": "Firefox is available now.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3bcd7b389e3724e130603123e55d0f580a2c8ce4ac0bb46208276811d247ba73.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.3]]}, {"text": "Chrome is in testing and should be released in the next few weeks.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f3097d48cf183250058b51cbb25e4e26f56ee77bdd6c14f9ee5c23ba2f7a5937.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.36], [9, 2.36, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.88], [12, 2.88, 3.2]]}, {"text": "If there’s enough interest, I’ll look at bringing these improvements to the iOS and Android apps as well.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/24a9507b5c61d1a616a822ae3a31e8f2d68b32a9487fe52b74b8a90a2bc431c9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 1.22], [4, 1.58, 1.66], [5, 1.66, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.72], [10, 2.72, 3.04], [11, 3.04, 3.16], [12, 3.16, 3.48], [13, 3.48, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 4.04], [15, 4.04, 4.34], [16, 4.34, 4.5], [17, 4.5, 4.68]]}, {"text": "The source code is open source github.com/KevinColemanInc/saigon-safe.", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2f5facef5230e7f54946b38dab19641bfb50e1f41391dc8f3b1dc83b62975d31.mp3"}, {"text": "If you’d like to review the changes, check out the GitHub repo below.", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/300883bcbb4aa348905c195dd2ee1eb38c0b58a36756da8482138d0f7eb00689.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.56], [4, 0.56, 0.78], [5, 0.78, 0.92], [6, 0.92, 1.28], [7, 1.8, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.24], [10, 2.24, 2.46], [11, 2.46, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.14]]}, {"text": "Amazing what becomes possible when AI reduces the cost of understanding and modifying large codebases.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/dfb4dbc0d4b9970ba030f8ec83717a0ebe91fd2b7bafb64430ba732e1aafe626.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.62], [12, 3.9, 4.26], [13, 4.26, 4.66]]}, {"text": "Commercial modules were removed to avoid violations of Bitwarden’s copyright file.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8215070cb72926076edcbf91f6d42930765319620ff0d171101d4908e6f5b754.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.78], [5, 1.78, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.56], [7, 2.56, 2.88], [9, 3.44, 3.82], [10, 3.82, 4.22]]}, {"text": "Feel free to contact me at kevin@sparkstart.io if you have any questions.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ddd4cf4d0ff434c6c2ee6006abd202e0d429388ac382733ae82277b8da1d6743.mp3"}]}